WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.270 --> 00:00:02.490
What's up everybody!

00:00:02.490 --> 00:00:06.600
We are Pongfinity and welcome to another episode
of Challenge Pongfinity!

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:11.130
This is the series where YOU challenge US
with your craziest ideas related to table

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:11.700
tennis.

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:15.200
We will go through all of your comments, pick
the most creative ones and make a video out

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:16.200
of them.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:19.370
If your idea gets picked, we will feature
it and give it a shout out.

00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:22.740
So make sure to leave your ideas in the comment-section below!

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:32.980
Marek Kowalski wants us to play 10 consecutive
shots with the edge of the racket.

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:34.480
Let's see how many we can get.

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:37.360
Kanav Chaudhri wants us to do 5 around the
net shots, let's do it!

00:01:54.560 --> 00:01:56.800
That's how you do it.

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:01.840
Rupam DAGA wants us to play table tennis using
a knife!

00:02:02.560 --> 00:02:04.960
Let's see how well we can slice with this
one.

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:37.280
Thanks Nickbrine Gaming, I have my racket
taped to my foot and I will try to go around

00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:38.560
the net with it.

00:04:20.640 --> 00:04:21.440
Thanks for watching guys!

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:25.630
If you enjoyed the video leave it a thumbs
up and if you are new to the channel subscribe

00:04:25.630 --> 00:04:26.870
right here.

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:29.560
And watch the previous episodes here.

00:04:29.560 --> 00:04:30.199
Until next time!

